"Recognises a returning browser so a visit is counted once instead of once "
"per page."
msgstr ""
"Reconnaît un navigateur qui revient, afin qu'une visite soit comptée une "
"fois au lieu d'une fois par page."

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:526
msgid "30 days"
msgstr "30 jours"

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:527
msgid ""
"Remembers that this visitor allowed analytics, so the choice survives the "
"next page load."
msgstr ""
"Retient que ce visiteur a autorisé les analyses, afin que le choix survive "
"au chargement de page suivant."

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:533 includes/brikpanel-consent.php:540
msgid "Until midnight"
msgstr "Jusqu'à minuit"

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:534
msgid ""
"Counts an add-to-cart once per day per visitor for the conversion funnel."
msgstr ""
"Compte un ajout au panier une fois par jour et par visiteur pour le tunnel "
"de conversion."

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:541
msgid ""
"Counts a checkout visit once per day per visitor for the conversion funnel."
msgstr ""
"Compte une visite de la commande une fois par jour et par visiteur pour le "
"tunnel de conversion."

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:547 includes/brikpanel-consent.php:558
msgid "Until cleared"
msgstr "Jusqu'à effacement"

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:548
msgid "Marks that this browser has already been counted as a visitor today."
msgstr ""
"Indique que ce navigateur a déjà été compté comme visiteur aujourd'hui."

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:559
msgid ""
"Marks that this browser has already been counted as a product viewer today."
msgstr ""
"Indique que ce navigateur a déjà été compté comme visiteur de produit "
"aujourd'hui."

#. translators: %d: number of completed orders reached (100 or 200).
#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:204
#, php-format
msgid "%d orders in. Want first access to BrikMentor?"
msgstr ""
"%d commandes au compteur. Vous voulez un accès prioritaire à BrikMentor ?"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:206
msgid "Get early access to BrikMentor"
msgstr "Obtenez un accès anticipé à BrikMentor"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:209
msgid ""
"We're building BrikMentor: an AI assistant that reads your store data, spots "
"what is driving (and leaking) revenue, and turns it into action, from smart "
"suggestions to email and marketing automation that reaches the right "
"customers, all inside WooCommerce. Your store now has enough data to get "
"real value from it. Join the private beta list and we'll invite you the "
"moment it opens."
msgstr ""
"Nous construisons BrikMentor : un assistant IA qui lit les données de votre "
"boutique, repère ce qui génère (et fait fuir) du chiffre d'affaires, et le "
"transforme en action, des suggestions intelligentes à l'automatisation des e-"
"mails et du marketing qui atteint les bons clients, le tout dans "
"WooCommerce. Votre boutique a maintenant assez de données pour en tirer une "
"vraie valeur. Rejoignez la liste de la bêta privée et nous vous inviterons "
"dès son ouverture."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:214
msgid "Select an option"
msgstr "Sélectionnez une option"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:215
msgid "None yet"
msgstr "Aucun pour l'instant"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:240
msgid "Your email"
msgstr "Votre e-mail"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:241
msgid "you@store.com"
msgstr "vous@boutique.com"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:246
msgid ""
"Email me about the BrikMentor beta and occasional BrikPanel tips. I can "
"unsubscribe at any time."
msgstr ""
"Envoyez-moi des e-mails sur la bêta de BrikMentor et des astuces "
"occasionnelles sur BrikPanel. Je peux me désabonner à tout moment."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:248
msgid "Please tick the box so we can email you the invite."
msgstr ""
"Veuillez cocher la case pour que nous puissions vous envoyer l'invitation "
"par e-mail."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:251
#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:1196
#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:1211
msgid "Join the early access list"
msgstr "Rejoindre la liste d'accès anticipé"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:254
msgid "No spam. Just the beta invite and the occasional heads-up."
msgstr ""
"Pas de spam. Juste l'invitation à la bêta et une information occasionnelle."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:263
msgid "You're on the list."
msgstr "Vous êtes sur la liste."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:264
msgid ""
"One quick question, totally optional: which email or marketing tool do you "
"use today? It helps us build the right thing."
msgstr ""
"Une question rapide, totalement facultative : quel outil d'e-mail ou de "
"marketing utilisez-vous aujourd'hui ? Cela nous aide à construire la bonne "
"chose."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:266
msgid "Email / marketing tool"
msgstr "Outil d'e-mail / marketing"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:275
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Passer"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:284
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Merci."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:285
msgid ""
"We'll email you the moment the BrikMentor beta opens. Thanks for helping "
"shape it."
msgstr ""
